<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST38"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Today4evr<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Today4evr<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, May 22, 2004 - 5:34 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->So grateful you created this site about BTK. When the publicity dies down and the memories will fade, the BTK forum on kansas.com will thin out but this one will still be here for people who will remember forever and want to see an end to this monster. Thank you.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
