<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST40"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sunflowergirl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sunflowergirl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, May 22, 2004 - 6:07 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Just want to say &#34;thank you&#34; Tom for the catchBTK  site.  I have been a long time reader of the Kansas.com site and although I didn&#39;t  feel comfortable posting on it, I am looking forward to participating here!   <!--/Text--></td></tr>
