<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST43"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Micaela<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Micaela<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, May 22, 2004 - 10:14 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hello Tom, <BR> <BR>Thank you for inviting me to be a part of this board. GREAT opening page. Hearing BTK&#39;s voice frquently is a really good idea. <BR> <BR>BTK wanted as much noteriety as the Zodiac, and now you are giving him his day in the sun. I hope he feels more comfortable talking to you about his work than he does with WPD. I do have the utmost respect for WPD, but everyone can use a helping hand fro experienced individuals. <BR> <BR>Micaela <!--/Text--></td></tr>
