<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST47"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Russell<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Russell<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, May 22, 2004 - 3:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Good mission statement ... good audio ... good reason for me to do whatever I can to help. I will lurk and haunt this site. I will do my best to contribute in a meaningful manner. <BR> <BR>Feel free to link to BRACEanalysis.com. <BR>Feel free to link to BRACEcharacterProfile.com <BR> <BR>I would encourage your &#34;posters&#34; to read the BRACE Character Profile of BTK at DeviantCrimes.com ... Serial Crimes/Serial Murderers section. <BR> <BR>When you get to the point of wanting to &#34;manage&#34; a BRACE Character Profile of BTK on your website, let me know. No charge. I suggest selecting the top 5 &#34;experts&#34; &#40;or teams of experts&#41; that you have available through your site 3, 6 or 12 months from now, and have them complete the 75 input ratings on the BRACE Character Profile. Then, average them and send them to me, decimal points and all. I will not only do a basic analysis, I will compare and contrast those you submit with the current profile available at DeviantCrimes.com. <BR> <BR>This is all about catching BTK. Right? I am at your disposal. <BR>Russell <!--/Text--></td></tr>
