<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST65"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doone<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doone<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, May 23, 2004 - 6:06 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks for this site.  I got my Java problem fixed and am now on my first chat room.Yours.  What fun.  I still get shivers on the homepage and after my husband got my new comp. speakers right, I&#39;ll be hearing BTKs&#39; voice in my sleep. <BR>You rock, as my 5 year old grandson says.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 65-->
<!--Post: 67--><!--Time: 1085367122-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST67"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Laoise<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Laoise<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, May 23, 2004 - 7:52 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->and i got booted from the chat...said internet connection problems or some such thing... and now i cant get back in. it keep getting to a part where its loading a java class thing and freezes the loading... i can do anything else on the net i want...except your chat. I also went to the infinitechat website to see if i could find a help file on my problem and the main page there loaded just fine but when i tried to go to the help page, it couldnt connect to the site...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 67-->
<!--Post: 74--><!--Time: 1085428559-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST74"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Micaela<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Micaela<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, May 24, 2004 - 12:55 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey Tom, <BR> <BR>I see you are catching a lot of flack over at C&amp;J. I have never posted there, but I have watched them. They are very intimidated by outsiders, &#40;especially ones who are trying to help with the BTK case&#41;. They have insulted John Douglas, Ken Landwehr and Robert Beattie. So, you are in good company. <BR> <BR>You have a great reputation for running an honest, mature website at zodiackiller.com. This one will catch on soon enough. <BR> <BR>If you get a chance, read what some guy named &#34;Runes&#34; at C&amp;J website said about the WPD. He said something like WPD is not necessary to solve this case or even be involved in it!  <BR> <BR>I agree that WPD should do some things differently. But they have been working on this for 30 years. I&#39;ll just bet they have good reasons for not giving out all the information they have. Hindsight will be 20/20, I&#39;ll bet. <BR> <BR>Keep up the good work and I will keep watching, posting if I learn anything new. BTK wanted as much publicity as the Zodiac was getting back in the 70&#39;s. I think this is the perfect forum for him to communicate the things he feels are misunderstood about him and his actions. <BR> <BR>Micaela<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 74-->
<!--Post: 75--><!--Time: 1085509770-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST75"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:webmaster@catchbtk.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Tom_voigt<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 25, 2004 - 11:29 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks for the feedback everyone. <BR> <BR>Micaela, that whole &#34;Crime &amp; Justice&#34; scene is a drag. I figured to take some heat because I&#39;m The New Guy, but sheesh! There are apparently even imposters posting silly things and claiming to be me. I guess I should be flattered, but I&#39;m not.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 75-->
<!--Post: 89--><!--Time: 1085539637-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST89"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Clarice<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Clarice<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 25, 2004 - 7:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom, I cannot open the Paging Sherlock Holmes article on your home page.  Is it working properly?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 89-->
<!--Post: 90--><!--Time: 1085540013-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST90"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilahsue<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilahsue<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 25, 2004 - 7:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Doone, how did you fix your chat problem?  I&#39;m having mine again.  I rebooted like last time I had this problem but it didn&#39;t fix it.  Anyone have any suggestions?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 90-->
