<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST100"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:webmaster@catchBTK.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Admin<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Admin<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, May 26, 2004 - 8:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Clarice, the article on my the main page isn&#39;t a link. It&#39;s just a small personal ad I&#39;ve posted in its entirety.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 100-->
<!--Post: 391--><!--Time: 1089142394-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST391"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Flytodeb<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Flytodeb<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, July 06, 2004 - 12:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Excellent website, Tom. On July 3, I posted a message &#40;that included a link to your website&#41; at the c&amp;j btk forum, and the moderators had it set up to disable the link. Instead of <a href="http://www.catchbtk.com" target=_top>www.catchbtk.com</a> as I typed it, it posted your website as www.@#%$.com which goes nowhere. Looks kind of like profanity. I was waiting to get banned from there for posting the link, but nothing yet. A couple of people asked me to post again; a thinly veiled query about your link? So on July 4, I posted: The catch phrase after the www is catch btk but don’t make it two words. I think if I had written catchbtk they would have busted me. <BR>-Deb <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 391-->
<!--Post: 447--><!--Time: 1089704237-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST447"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, July 13, 2004 - 12:37 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Good, serious posters who know it&#39;s okay to laugh once in a while will, and already have, begin to gravitate <BR>here. It&#39;s an excellent site which will keep getting better. Of course, I think <a href="http://www.zodiackiller.com" target=_top>www.zodiackiller.com</a> is one of the best sites -- of any kind -- on the entire Internet. The proof of that is the caliber of the regular posters. I have no doubt <a href="http://www.catchbtk.com" target=_top>www.catchbtk.com</a> will follow in Zodiac&#39;s size 10 1/2 footsteps. Great job, Tom!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 447-->
<!--Post: 730--><!--Time: 1092196981-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST730"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, August 10, 2004 - 9:03 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom, <BR>Is there space enough here for you to create a &#34;BTK Mail,&#34; along the lines of &#34;Z Mail?&#34;  <BR> <BR>As an unregenerate fan of the Z Mail feature on the Zodiac site &#40;which not nearly enough people read&#41; I thought I&#39;d ask.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 730-->
<!--Post: 770--><!--Time: 1092590426-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST770"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, August 15, 2004 - 10:20 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I would like to thank sincerely the Wichitans and <BR>Kansans who have helped those of us who live on the west or east coast. I appreciate it, for instance, if I ask a question about a specific Wichita location or anything else which can only be answered by <u>being in</u> Wichita. It&#39;s a perfect example of the importance of sharing information and I thank you all very much! <BR> <BR>George<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 770-->
<!--Post: 1227--><!--Time: 1097848911-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1227"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:hackenmaster@cox.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Wichitan<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wichitan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, October 15, 2004 - 7:01 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom,  <BR> <BR>I think your web site looks great, I am a  webmaster myself, and from webmaster to webmaster....you have done a great job!  Thanks for the account, and hope anything i post is useful to someone. <BR> <BR>wichitan<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1227-->
<!--Post: 1370--><!--Time: 1099688959-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1370"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Megan<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Megan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, November 05, 2004 - 1:09 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This great website, keep up the good work! <BR> <BR>I&#39;m new to this case, and I came across this site. <BR> <BR>Regards, <BR>Megan<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1370-->
<!--Post: 1381--><!--Time: 1099713157-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1381"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, November 05, 2004 - 7:52 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->tom, <BR> <BR>Your site is very user friendly. It is simple to navigate and the links are also very interesting.  .  .  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1381-->
<!--Post: 1614--><!--Time: 1102334658-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1614"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, December 06, 2004 - 4:04 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom: The site is great. The threads are on topic and the comments are relative and logical. I have looked at other sites and there is name calling and other crapola. One cannot post because some comments not on topic do not even make sense. Clearly, those who post here are of superior intelligence and insight. You are doing a great job and doing the victims a service.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1614-->
<!--Post: 1616--><!--Time: 1102354252-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1616"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, December 06, 2004 - 9:30 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->TOM &amp; Everyone: This site is great &amp; I have an idea: What if we organized a 5-day &#34;Catch BTK&#34; trip to Wichita? It would contain a BTK tour of the known murder scenes, places he left victims&#39; cars, letter-drops, etc. We could rent a mini-van once there &amp; travel / live fairly cheaply! <BR>   Of course it would be rather spooky, but that might be part of the attraction.... <BR>   Just a thought.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1616-->
<!--Post: 1636--><!--Time: 1102480276-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1636"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Wichitaboy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wichitaboy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 07, 2004 - 8:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->That would be fun.  Count me in. <BR> <BR>Mark<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1636-->
<!--Post: 1642--><!--Time: 1102486933-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1642"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 07, 2004 - 10:22 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->To respond to this I&#39;ve started up a new thread; &#34;CATCH BTK Trip Proposed&#34;. Hopefully TOM will approve. Thank you.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1642-->
